POST {{gateway}}/anthropic/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv GATEWAY_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{$processEnv APIM_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY}}
anthropic-version: {{$processEnv ANTHROPIC_VERSION}}

{"model":"{{anthropicModel}}","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Hello"}],"max_tokens":64}

### Messages fast alias
POST {{gateway}}/anthropic/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv GATEWAY_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{$processEnv APIM_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY}}
anthropic-version: {{$processEnv ANTHROPIC_VERSION}}

{"model":"{{fastAnthropicModel}}","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Hello"}],"max_tokens":64}
